fate-popup = The Winds have decided what you are.
fate-announce = The Winds mark you.
    Instability: {$instability}. The higher it is, the stronger you are, and the less the Winds listen.
    {$aspects}

aspect-fragile-mind-name = Fragile Mind
aspect-fragile-mind-desc = Spells cost less, but the Winds snap back more often.
aspect-deep-well-name = Deep Well
aspect-deep-well-desc = You hold far more Wind, but it returns slowly.
aspect-trickle-name = Trickle
aspect-trickle-desc = You hold little Wind, but it returns fast.
aspect-tangled-name = Tangled
aspect-tangled-desc = You can weave larger spells, and the weave is looser.
aspect-plain-name = Plain
aspect-plain-desc = Smaller weaves, more of them, and cheaper to cast.
aspect-profligate-name = Profligate
aspect-profligate-desc = Everything costs more, and recovers faster.
aspect-collector-name = Collector
aspect-collector-desc = You can keep many more woven spells, but your reserves are smaller.
aspect-unmoored-name = Unmoored
aspect-unmoored-desc = The Winds slip often, but you recover quickly.

fate-announce-kit = You work magic through: {$disciplines}.
    You are attuned to: {$schools}. Glyphs of those schools cost you less.

aspect-wellspring-name = Wellspring
aspect-wellspring-desc = You hold more Wind, and everything costs a little more.
aspect-anchored-name = Anchored
aspect-anchored-desc = The Winds slip rarely, but you recover a little slower.
aspect-weaver-name = Weaver
aspect-weaver-desc = You can weave larger spells, but hold less Wind.
aspect-scatterbrained-name = Scatterbrained
aspect-scatterbrained-desc = You can hold many more woven spells, but each is smaller, and the Winds slip a little more.
aspect-flicker-name = Flicker
aspect-flicker-desc = Wind returns very fast, but you hold little and the Winds slip often.
aspect-thrifty-name = Thrifty
aspect-thrifty-desc = Spells are cheaper, and Wind returns a little slower.
aspect-tempest-name = Tempest
aspect-tempest-desc = More Wind and faster recovery, but everything costs more and the Winds are wild.
aspect-hollowvessel-name = Hollow Vessel
aspect-hollowvessel-desc = Spells cost far less, but you can barely hold any Wind.

fate-announce-errands = The Winds will ask small things of you around the station. Open your tome and look at Errands: each one you finish makes you stronger.
